# Pump encoding, GFO (pins: Onto-Med/GFO @ 233b38d, gfo-base module).
# R1: the typed parthood suite. gfo-base ships part_of with typed
# refinements (constituent_part_of, categorial_part_of,
# abstract_part_of); a material component is asserted by part_of.
@prefix gfob: <https://w3id.org/gfo/base/> .
@prefix p:    <https://example.org/mt-pump#> .

p:impeller a gfob:Presential ;
    gfob:part_of p:pump .
p:pump a gfob:Presential .

# R2: the impeller-housing joint is inexpressible at this layer. The
# theory defines boundary coincidence (the two-level doctrine), but the
# artifact ships no connection or coincidence relation; the front page
# names coincidence among the outstanding features, and no artifact
# vocabulary can state it.
